{"title": "Activate Witch Bolt", "pageid": 29571, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Activate_Witch_Bolt", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Evocation spells", "Actions", "Sources of Lightning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp/300px-Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp, /w/images/0/07/Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp/300px-Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Activate_Witch_Bolt.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Activate Witch Bolt </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip (Evocation)</a>. It allows spellcasters to electrocute targets connected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Witch Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/38px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/50px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Witch Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Witch Bolt\">Witch Bolt</a> dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Activate the bolt and deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a>. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">If not activated each turn, the arc dissipates and the spell ends.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D12_Lightning.png/29px-D12_Lightning.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D12_Lightning.png/43px-D12_Lightning.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D12_Lightning.png/58px-D12_Lightning.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D12_Lightning.png/29px-D12_Lightning.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/D12_Lightning.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d12</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 30 m (100 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 30 m (100 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_WitchBolt_Activate</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_WitchBolt_Activate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_WitchBolt_Activate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Witch Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/38px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/50px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Witch Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Witch Bolt\">Witch Bolt</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Activate Witch Bolt is classified as a <a href=\"/wiki/Cantrip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cantrip\">cantrip</a> and will benefit from cantrip exclusive boosts like the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necklace_of_Elemental_Augmentation\" title=\"Necklace of Elemental Augmentation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Necklace_of_Elemental_Augmentation\" title=\"Necklace of Elemental Augmentation\">Necklace of Elemental Augmentation</a>. On the other hand, it will not activate abilities like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tempestuous_Magic\" title=\"Tempestuous Magic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/25px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/38px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/50px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tempestuous Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/25px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tempestuous_Magic\" title=\"Tempestuous Magic\">Tempestuous Magic</a> that require casting leveled spells.</li>\n<li>Unlike the initial cast of Witch Bolt, Activate Witch Bolt has no <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. The damage is guaranteed.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/3/30/Witch_Bolt_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Witch_Bolt_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Witch_Bolt_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Witch_bolt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Witch bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Witch_bolt\">Witch bolt</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041136\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time u